\s1 God’s Works Remain Forever
\p \v 9 \w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w does the worker|strong="H06213"\w* \w gain|strong="H03504"\w* \w from his|strong="H01931"\w* \w toil|strong="H06001"\w*? \v 10 \w I have seen|strong="H07200"\w* \w the burden|strong="H06045"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w God|strong="H00430"\w* \w has laid|strong="H05414"\w* \w upon the sons|strong="H01121"\w* \w of men|strong="H00120"\w* \w to occupy|strong="H06031"\w* them. \v 11 \w He has made|strong="H06213"\w* \w everything|strong="H03605"\w* \w beautiful|strong="H03303"\w* \w in its time|strong="H06256"\w*. \w He has also|strong="H01571"\w* \w set|strong="H05414"\w* \w eternity|strong="H05769"\w* \w in the hearts of men|strong="H03820"\w*, \w yet|strong="H01097"\w* \w they|strong="H00120"\w* \w cannot|strong="H03808"\w* \w fathom|strong="H04672"\w* \w the work|strong="H04639"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w God|strong="H00430"\w* \w has done|strong="H06213"\w* \w from beginning|strong="H07218"\w* \w to|strong="H05704"\w* \w end|strong="H05490"\w*.
